issues/104594","id":2751112404,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6j-qTU","user":{"login":"ttencate","id":90930,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwOTMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/90930?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate","html_url":"https://github.com/ttencate","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-25T12:34:11Z","updated_at":"2025-03-25T12:35:19Z","body":"Good thought, but unfortunately it also happens when I switch to 3D.\n\nIt still happens when I unassign the shortcuts `Shift+5` and `Shift+Kp 5` from \"Zoom to 3.125%\", and `5` and `Kp 5` from \"Zoom to 1600%\" for good measure as well.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2751112404/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2751125547","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104594#issuecomment-2751125547","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104594","id":2751125547,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6j-tgr","user":{"login":"kleonc","id":9283098,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkyODMwOTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9283098?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc","html_url":"https://github.com/kleonc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-25T12:39:13Z","updated_at":"2025-03-25T12:39:13Z","body":"Tested in v4.4.stable.official [4c311cbee], and in current `master` (v4.5.dev.custom_build [6b5b84c0c]):\n\nIt works / doesn't work based on what's focused. Right after the selecting nodes in the scene tree dock it doesn't work.\n\nHere I'm constantly toggling it:\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d7bf8839-44a2-4924-988a-a47e0f3ba90e)\n\n>Does this happen when in the 2D editor only? It is used for a specific zoom level in that editor\n\nIf 2D Viewport is focused (happens when moving mouse over it) it does work, it both sets the zoom and toggles unique name(s).\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/edcdc199-110c-441e-aa74-e8a7f64da3a6)","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2751125547/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":1,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2751779440","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104594#issuecomment-2751779440","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104594","id":2751779440,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6kBNJw","user":{"login":"EricEzaM","id":41730826,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxNzMwODI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41730826?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EricEzaM","html_url":"https://github.com/EricEzaM","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EricEzaM/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EricEzaM/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EricEzaM/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EricEzaM/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EricEzaM/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EricEzaM/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EricEzaM/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EricEzaM/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EricEzaM/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-25T16:06:19Z","updated_at":"2025-03-25T16:11:07Z","body":"This is what is happening:\n\n1. When input is received, nodes get `gui_input` called on them first, before `shortcut_input`.\n2. The `Tree` control used for the scene tree dock is handling `gui_input` and doing some processing.\n3. It sees that the key pressed is a valid unicode key, and so based on these conditions it does a incremental search for that unicode character.\n4. It performs an incremental search, and accepts the event. This prevents any further input processing.\n\nThis is the code being triggered, specifically the branch `if (k->get_unicode() > 0) {`\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/a76c1ac1d65db5ab7e7f996830a7c86c4dee1f4a/scene/gui/tree.cpp#L3678-L3704\n\nWhat is happening is more clear if you change the shortcut to be Shift + 4 (unicode $) since if you try create a node `%test`, godot will remove the `%` and give it the unique name:\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5a3af120-4450-419f-b90b-ee2e57e1c74d)\n\nI have created a node `$test` which as you can see in the video below, is selected when I press the shortcut (Shift + 4 = $) due to the incremental search for `$`.\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7fd72140-5399-4a50-911b-6be0054f8078\n\nNot sure what the solution is here. Probably \"pick a different shortcut\" but I know that sucks. Processing shortcuts before input is a huge change that would break many things so is not viable.\n\nIt works if you have the viewport focused, as the viewport does not do any pre-shortcut input handling of this key combination, and the shortcut ends up getting handled globally by the scene tree dock. Note this works for any focused control that has this behaviour, e.g. if you focus the inspector then the shortcut still works too (again, it is treated as being global)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2751779440/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2752436031","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104594#issuecomment-2752436031","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104594","id":2752436031,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6kDtc_","user":{"login":"ttencate","id":90930,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwOTMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/90930?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate","html_url":"https://github.com/ttencate","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-25T20:26:52Z","updated_at":"2025-03-25T20:26:52Z","body":"That makes total sense, thank you for digging into this! I wasn't even aware of the incremental search feature, otherwise I'd have thought of it myself.\n\nClosing as not feasible.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2752436031/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]